      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teofilo, mu mukanda wa diambedi nakafunda malu onso akabanga Yesu kuenza ne kuyisha bantu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tô ne ku dituku diakangatshibueye mu diulu, hakamaneye kuambika bapostolo bakasunguleye mikenshi yandi kudi Nyuma Muimpe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamaneye kukenga, wakamueneka kudibo ne muoyo, bimanyinu bia buala ebu biakadi bia bungi, wakamuenekamueneka kudibo nunku matuku makumi anai Wamba malu a bukelenge bua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadisangisheye nʼabo, wakabambila bikole ne, Kanumuki mu Yelushalema, kadi nujidile mulayi wa Tatu unuakunvua kundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, Yone wakabatiza bantu ne mai, kadi matuku kêna mashale a bungi anuabatijibua mu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mu anyi ne.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyuma Muimpe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadisangishabo nunku, bakadi ukonka ne, Mukelenge, wewe neuhingishe Isalele bukelenge katataka, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabambila ne, Kumanya kua bikondo ne bidimu biakusungula Tatu mu bukokeshi buandi kambualu buenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nuenu nenuangate bukole, hanuhuekela Nyuma Muimpe hamʼbidi henu; nenuikale bamanyi banyi mu Yelushalema ne mu Yudaya yonso ne Samalea ne kunfudilu kua buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakambeye dî edi, hakadibo bamutangila, wakangatshibua mu diulu; ditutu diakamuangata, kabakamumona kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadiye uya, bakatangila mu diulu talala; monai, balume babidi bimane ha buihi nʼabo baluate bilulu bitoke tô; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bakamba ne, Nuenu Bena Galela, nudi bimane nutangidila mu diulu tshinyi? Yesu eu wakadi nʼenu wakubandishibua mu diulu, nealue kabidi bu munuakumumona ubanda mu diulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bakahingana mu Yelushalema bafuma ku mukuna udibo babikila ne, Oleve, udi biau hehi ne Yelushalema, bu ntanta wa luendu lua dituku dia Lumingu tua Bayuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahinganabo, bakabanda mu nsubu wa mulu, muakadi muikale Petelo ne Yone ne Yakobo ne Andele ne Filipo ne Toma ne Bâtolomayo ne Matayo ne Yakobo muana wa Alafayo ne Simona muena Lukunukunu ne Yuda wa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buonso buabo bakadi ne mitshima muomumue, bakananukila kutendelela Nzambi, ne bakashi, ne Malia mamu wa Yesu, ne bana babo ne Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku â Petelo wakimana munkatshi mua bana babo ba mu Kilisto, bakadi badisangishe nunku bu lukama ne makumi abidi, yeye wakamba ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana betu, buakadibo nʼabo mbua kushikisha dî didi difunda mu Mukanda wa Nzambi, diakambabo bua Yudasa diambedi kudi Nyuma Muimpe mukana mua Davidi, yeye wakadi mulombodi wa bakuatshi ba Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakadi bamubala nʼetu, wakadi mumane kuangata luandi luseke lua mudimu eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Muntu eu wakasumba muaba ku difutu dia bubi buandi; wakahona mutu munshi, wakahandika hankatshi, mala andi onso akahatuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yelushalema bonso bakamanya bualu ebu; ebu mbualu buakabikidilabo muaba au ne, Akeledama, kukudimuna kua muaku ne, Muaba wa Mashi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakafunda mu Mukanda wa Misambu ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
